'''Forest West''' is a [[Locations|location]] that contains [[Aurora Vineyard]], the entrance to [[Sprite Spring]] and the Bear Shop. 

It is found to the west of Cindersap Forest and there's a mass of pine trees, many foragables, and a small river for fishing in the southwest corner.

==[[Aurora Vineyard]]==
[[File:Aurora Vineyard.png|right|200px]]
Located in the northwestern corner of the forest, a dilapidated house and its land sits abandoned. See Page: [[Aurora Vineyard]].
==[[File:Bear Vendor.png|80px]]Bear Shop==
''Note: Only open once fulfilling the quest from [[Stardew:Secret_Notes#Secret_Note_.2323|Secret Note #23]]''.<br>
The Bear's cave is located in the northwest corner of Forest West. It is reached by following a path to the southwest of Aurora Vineyard and finding a break in the treeline. Continuing north through two tree breaks leads to the cave. 

The shop is a good source for quest, recipe, and crafting ingredients that are not available every season. 
